viduals, professionals, corporate clients, and institutions, as well as asset management, insurance, protection, pensions, and private banking services. The company was formerly known as Banque Nationale de Paris and changed its name to BNP Paribas SA in May 2000. BNP Paribas SA was founded in 1822 and is headquartered in Paris, France.","fullTimeEmployees":180000,"city":"Paris","country":"France","website":"https://group.bnpparibas","industry":"Banks - Regional","sector":"Financial Services"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-24"}